# ALERT NGO - frontend environment
# Copy this file to frontend/.env (git-ignored) and fill in real values.

# No key is needed for Telugu / Hindi: the site uses Google's built-in website
# translator (frontend/src/i18n/googleTranslate.js), driven by the EN/తె/हि buttons
# in the top bar. If Google cannot be reached, the written translations in
# frontend/src/i18n/{te,hi}.json are shown instead.
